---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy policy | Hivecrest Systems"
  description="How Hivecrest Systems collects, uses and protects information submitted through hivecrestsystems.com."
  path="/privacy.html"
>
<Fragment slot="head">
<style is:inline>
body{margin:0}
a{color:#18181B}a:hover{color:#5F5E5A}
[hidden]{display:none !important}
</style>
</Fragment>
<div style="background: #F6F5F1; color: #18181B; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif">

<header style="background: #141416; color: #EDEBE4">
<div style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px 32px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px">
<a href="index.html" aria-label="Hivecrest Systems home" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; text-decoration: none; color: #EDEBE4">
<svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" width="40" height="40" aria-hidden="true">
<polygon points="50,21.5 64.29,29.75 64.29,46.25 50,54.5 35.71,46.25 35.71,29.75" fill="#E39A2B"></polygon>
<polyline points="42.5,43 50,35.5 57.5,43" fill="none" stroke="#141416" stroke-width="3.6" stroke-linecap="square"></polyline>
<polygon points="34.41,48.5 48.7,56.75 48.7,73.25 34.41,81.5 20.12,73.25 20.12,56.75" fill="#EDEBE4"></polygon>
<polygon points="65.59,48.5 79.88,56.75 79.88,73.25 65.59,81.5 51.3,73.25 51.3,56.75" fill="#EDEBE4"></polygon>
</svg>
<span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-weight: 800; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: -0.5px">hivecrest</span>
</a>
<a href="index.html" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; padding: 0 18px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #5F5E5A; color: #EDEBE4; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none">Back to homepage</a>
</div>
<div style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 56px 32px 72px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px">
<p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 2px; color: #E39A2B">LEGAL</p>
<h1 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(36px, 4.4vw, 60px); line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: -1.5px">Privacy policy</h1>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #C9C7BF">Effective date: [EFFECTIVE DATE] · Last updated: [DATE]</p>
</div>
</header>

<main style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 72px 32px 112px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 56px; align-items: flex-start">

<nav aria-label="On this page" style="flex: 1 1 220px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px">
<p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 1.5px; color: #5F5E5A">ON THIS PAGE</p>
<ol style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.4; color: #3A3A3F">
<li><a href="#p-collect" style="color: #3A3A3F">Information we collect</a></li>
<li><a href="#p-use" style="color: #3A3A3F">How we use it</a></li>
<li><a href="#p-share" style="color: #3A3A3F">How we share it</a></li>
<li><a href="#p-cookies" style="color: #3A3A3F">Cookies and third parties</a></li>
<li><a href="#p-dnt" style="color: #3A3A3F">Do Not Track</a></li>
<li><a href="#p-keep" style="color: #3A3A3F">How long we keep it</a></li>
<li><a href="#p-protect" style="color: #3A3A3F">How we protect it</a></li>
<li><a href="#p-rights" style="color: #3A3A3F">Your choices and rights</a></li>
<li><a href="#p-children" style="color: #3A3A3F">Children</a></li>
<li><a href="#p-changes" style="color: #3A3A3F">Changes to this policy</a></li>
<li><a href="#p-contact" style="color: #3A3A3F">Contact us</a></li>
</ol>
</nav>

<article style="flex: 999 1 560px; min-width: 0; max-width: 760px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 48px">

<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.7; color: #18181B">Hivecrest Systems LLC ("Hivecrest," "we," "us") operates hivecrestsystems.com. This policy explains what information we collect through the site, how we use it, and the choices you have.</p>

<section id="p-collect" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 1.25">1. Information we collect</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; color: #3A3A3F"><strong style="color: #18181B">Information you give us.</strong> When you request our portfolio, book a call or email us, we collect what you share: your name, email address, company name, the type of project you're planning, and anything you include in your message.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; color: #3A3A3F"><strong style="color: #18181B">Information collected automatically.</strong> Like most websites, our hosting provider records basic technical information when you visit, such as your IP address, browser type, the pages you view and the time of your visit. We use it to keep the site running and secure.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; color: #3A3A3F">Please don't send sensitive information, such as Social Security numbers, financial account details or health information, through our forms or email.</p>
</section>

<section id="p-use" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 1.25">2. How we use it</h2>
<ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; color: #3A3A3F">
<li>To reply to your inquiry and send the examples you asked for</li>
<li>To schedule and prepare for calls with you</li>
<li>To provide our services if you become a client</li>
<li>To keep the website working and secure</li>
<li>To meet our legal, tax and accounting obligations</li>
</ul>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; color: #3A3A3F">We won't use your information for an unrelated purpose without asking you first.</p>
</section>

<section id="p-share" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 1.25">3. How we share it</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; color: #3A3A3F">We do not sell or rent personal information, and we do not share it for targeted advertising. We share it only with service providers that help us run the business, and only as much as they need to do that work:</p>
<ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; color: #3A3A3F">
<li>Website hosting: [HOSTING PROVIDER]</li>
<li>Form handling: [FORM SERVICE]</li>
<li>Email: [EMAIL PROVIDER]</li>
<li>Call scheduling: [SCHEDULING TOOL]</li>
</ul>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; color: #3A3A3F">We may also disclose information when the law requires it, to protect our rights or the safety of others, or as part of a merger or sale of the business.</p>
</section>

<section id="p-cookies" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 1.25">4. Cookies and third parties</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; color: #3A3A3F">We don't use advertising cookies or cross-site tracking. Our site loads its fonts from Google Fonts, so your browser connects to Google's servers and Google receives your IP address. Google's use of that information is covered by its own privacy policy.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; color: #3A3A3F">Apart from the service providers listed above, we do not allow third parties to collect personal information about your online activities over time and across different websites through our site.</p>
</section>

<section id="p-dnt" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 1.25">5. Do Not Track</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; color: #3A3A3F">Some browsers can send a "Do Not Track" signal. Because we don't track visitors across websites, our site works the same way whether or not that signal is turned on.</p>
</section>

<section id="p-keep" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 1.25">6. How long we keep it</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; color: #3A3A3F">We keep inquiry information for as long as we need it to respond and follow up, and no longer than [24 months] after our last contact with you. If you become a client, we keep project records for as long as the work requires and as long as the law requires for tax and accounting purposes.</p>
</section>

<section id="p-protect" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 1.25">7. How we protect it</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; color: #3A3A3F">We use reasonable safeguards to protect your information, including encrypted connections (HTTPS), two-factor authentication on our business accounts, and access limited to the people who need it. No system is completely secure, but we work to keep your information safe.</p>
</section>

<section id="p-rights" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 1.25">8. Your choices and rights</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; color: #3A3A3F">You can contact us at any time to:</p>
<ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; color: #3A3A3F">
<li>Find out what personal information we hold about you</li>
<li>Correct information that is wrong</li>
<li>Ask us to delete your information</li>
<li>Stop receiving follow-up emails from us</li>
</ul>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; color: #3A3A3F">We'll respond within 45 days. Depending on where you live, your state's privacy law may give you additional rights, and we'll honor them where they apply.</p>
</section>

<section id="p-children" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 1.25">9. Children</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; color: #3A3A3F">Our site is meant for businesses and organizations and is not directed to anyone under 18. We don't knowingly collect personal information from children. If you believe a child has sent us information, contact us and we'll delete it.</p>
</section>

<section id="p-changes" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 1.25">10. Changes to this policy</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; color: #3A3A3F">When we update this policy, we'll post the new version on this page and change the "Last updated" date at the top. If a change materially affects information we already hold about you, we'll also let you know by email where we can.</p>
</section>

<section id="p-contact" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E2E0D8; border-radius: 12px; padding: 32px">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 1.25">11. Contact us</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; color: #3A3A3F">For questions about this policy or to make a request about your information, contact:</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; color: #18181B">Hivecrest Systems LLC<br>[MAILING ADDRESS]<br><a href="mailto:hello@hivecrestsystems.com" style="color: #18181B; font-weight: 600">hello@hivecrestsystems.com</a></p>
</section>

</article>
</main>

<footer style="background: #141416; color: #A3A29C">
<div style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 28px 32px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; font-size: 14px">
<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px">
<svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" width="28" height="28" aria-hidden="true">
<polygon points="50,21.5 64.29,29.75 64.29,46.25 50,54.5 35.71,46.25 35.71,29.75" fill="#E39A2B"></polygon>
<polyline points="42.5,43 50,35.5 57.5,43" fill="none" stroke="#141416" stroke-width="3.6" stroke-linecap="square"></polyline>
<polygon points="34.41,48.5 48.7,56.75 48.7,73.25 34.41,81.5 20.12,73.25 20.12,56.75" fill="#EDEBE4"></polygon>
<polygon points="65.59,48.5 79.88,56.75 79.88,73.25 65.59,81.5 51.3,73.25 51.3,56.75" fill="#EDEBE4"></polygon>
</svg>
<span>© 2026 Hivecrest Systems LLC · Maryland</span>
</div>
<nav aria-label="Legal" style="display: flex; gap: 24px">
<a href="privacy.html" aria-current="page" style="color: #EDEBE4">Privacy</a>
<a href="#top" style="color: #A3A29C">Accessibility</a>
</nav>
</div>
</footer>

</div>
</BaseLayout>
